OL,3,GNEWSAWhite wallaby hops through Suffolk
OL,4,Acountryside
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was left in "disbelief" when he
OL,7,Fsaw a white wallaby hopping around in
OL,8,Ffront of his tractor.
OL,10,FJordan Carter was cutting verges for
OL,11,FSuffolk's highways department near
OL,12,FEdwardstone village on Wednesday when
OL,13,Fhe spotted the marsupial.
OL,15,FHe said his wife was so doubtful about
OL,16,Fhis sighting, that she thought his
OL,17,Fvideo was created using AI.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
