OL,3,GNEWSAWhite wallaby hops through Suffolk
OL,4,Acountryside
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn apparent albino wallaby was also
OL,7,Fspotted not far away in 2017 - between
OL,8,FListon and Glemsford which is also
OL,9,Fclose to Sudbury - and Carter said it
OL,10,Fwould be lovely to know if the same
OL,11,Fanimal had survived in the wild.
